    "narrative": "Our strongest play today is **Corbin Carroll** (81.14), who benefits from a salivating matchup against Pecko. With an elite sprint speed profile essential for our aggressive SB-chasing strategy, **Carroll** enters the day in an ideal position to exploit a 6.19 xERA arm. Close behind is **Trevor Story** (75.93), whose score is buoyed significantly by a favorable park factor and a solid #4 spot in the order, and **Jose Caballero** (74.42), whose dynamic platoon edge against the lefty Ray keeps his value high despite a bottom-of-the-order assignment. **Vinnie Pasquantino** (72.92) is also a standout, utilizing an elite platoon matchup against the struggling Scherzer to anchor our UTIL slot.\n\nThe most difficult bench decision involved **Austin Riley**, who yielded a score of 43.98. While his power upside is usually a staple, he was effectively neutralized by a difficult matchup against the elite Wheeler (3.27 xERA). The optimizer favored the higher floor and platoon advantages offered by **Vinnie Pasquantino** and **Isaac Paredes**, as we simply cannot afford the efficiency drop-off that a matchup against an ace like Wheeler creates this late in the season. **Max Muncy** (49.28) and **Cole Young** (48.61) narrowly held onto their spots, though their scores remain precarious; we are keeping a close eye on **Cole Young**'s production, as his position near the bottom of the lineup and the presence of an elite defensive catcher behind the plate slightly dampens his overall stolen base expectation.\n\nWe remain on high alert regarding **James Wood** (49.75), who faces the toughest pitcher of the day in Glasnow (2.91 xERA). Despite his elite xwOBA metrics, his score is severely hampered by the opponent\u2019s skill level. **Seiya Suzuki** (58.75) rounds out our outfield; while his score is respectable, his utility is somewhat capped by the opposing pitcher's ability to limit base-stealing opportunities. With **Giancarlo Stanton** confirmed on the IL and **Mickey Moniak** out of the lineup, we are fully committed to this configuration to maximize our daily efficiency and chase those critical categories.",
